  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Case 1 Mary 1.1.1_en-GB
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en-GB
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 75dfe886a521ebe4ba124ec328fcef77, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 6860373012504576
    m_Localized: 'Few bruises. Nothing more. For two people who weren''t exactly
      lovebirds that fight was pretty calm. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373075419136
    m_Localized: The kitchen looks like someone threw a body around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373075419137
    m_Localized: There would be at least cuts. Not to mention broken bones or twisted
      ankles. Or are you two some superhumans with iron skin?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373075419138
    m_Localized: I assumed he had to do it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373075419139
    m_Localized: He went crazy after all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373075419140
    m_Localized: Sophie could also be trying to grab someone's attention when this
      monster attacked her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373075419141
    m_Localized: Ten minutes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373075419142
    m_Localized: Assuming you are not lying and you perfectly dodged each other.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373075419143
    m_Localized: Ten minutes. That's how much time your husband would have to commit
      the crime.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373075419144
    m_Localized: He couldn't know when you'd come back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373075419145
    m_Localized: Why would he waste time destroying the kitchen?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373075419146
    m_Localized: Since when do we expect rationality from UnPersons?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373075419147
    m_Localized: I'll tell you what I think.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373075419148
    m_Localized: Someone destroyed the kitchen before youleft to the neighbor's.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373079613440
    m_Localized: Someone lost control, went mad.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373079613441
    m_Localized: Fell into uncontrolled rage. A common sight among newborn UnPersons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373079613442
    m_Localized: It wasn't me, officer! I swear! Don't let him deceive you. He planned
      it to pin it on me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373079613443
    m_Localized: He always did it, putting his faults on me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373079613444
    m_Localized: Screaming won't help you, suspect. I suggest giving me some alibi
      or proof.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373079613445
    m_Localized: Otherwise...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373079613446
    m_Localized: Just let's think, how could I make such a mess and kil... did this
      crime?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373079613447
    m_Localized: Every neighbor would hear it and call the services.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373079613448
    m_Localized: Besides, if I did it and specially left the apartment to pin it
      on him...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373079613449
    m_Localized: Even though it was the other way around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373083807744
    m_Localized: I wouldn't be able to time it so perfectly to dodge each other.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6860373083807745
    m_Localized: I couldn't do it! I wouldn't NO MATTER WHAT KILL SOPHIE!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
